{"detail": {"templateUuid": "3ab5b0ba6a654d35bc2a6ba4a8ff6d40", "projectUuid": "d87af006803e4fe1ad0e2225b7abcd43", "name": "Image2 + Seedance2.0 连贯Ai长视频工作流分享", "description": "最近看到很多人用Image2模型，一上来就把一整张复杂分镜/设定图丢给模型。\n但问题是，Seedance2.0 单条最长也就 15 秒。\n你塞进去的镜头越多，模型越容易乱切、变脸、动作接不上。\n我这次用 Image2 + Seedance2.0 跑了一套更稳定的流程，这条视频重点不是工具按钮，而是怎么用导演分镜逻辑，让 AI 视频真正连起来。对做短剧的朋友，绝对是个好方法！", "coverUrl": "/assets/78149cb6e68451c5.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/db2f003ebdbf4f919d9f248eaa77ead9/38f6311ff37628cc6fb6cf0d9d85bc8ae96d9430.mp4", "snapshotId": 14196, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 4166157, "ownerUuid": "db2f003ebdbf4f919d9f248eaa77ead9", "avatar": "/assets/3f5ae1ad48a903fd.webp", "nickname": "ShineAi", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 92, "tags": [{"id": 1503, "code": "teaching", "tagLabel": "教学教程", "parentTag": 1500, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1500/1503/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "createAt": "2026年05月25日 19:24", "updateAt": "2026年05月29日 16:06", "publishAt": "2026年05月25日 19:24", "playCount": 26, "viewCreationProcessCount": 5, "copyCanvasCount": 1, "shareCount": 1, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/3ab5b0ba6a654d35bc2a6ba4a8ff6d40.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 47, "edges": 49}}, "recommendList": []}